s survive failure; do not resend uncertain work.","name":"send_message","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"expects_reply":{"type":"boolean"},"recipients":{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"text":{"maxLength":16000,"type":"string"}},"required":["recipients","text","expects_reply"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Cancel only queued, running or paused teammate deliveries originally sent by you to this recipient, including their unfinished descendants. User work, other senders and channel-origin work are excluded. A no-reply notice records your reason in a new recipient conversation. Cancellation cannot undo provider effects already accepted. Private conversations only; never interrupt yourself or a requester.","name":"interrupt_agent","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"reason":{"maxLength":2000,"type":"string"},"recipient":{"type":"string"}},"required":["recipient","reason"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Suspend this task until a signed event arrives. User configures its per-request connection in the conversation; no secret is exposed to you. Supply exact event name and timeout1..604800seconds. Resume receives event payload as untrusted data. No worker stays occupied. Maximum8 waits per task; expiry fails the task.","name":"wait_for_event","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event":{"maxLength":256,"type":"string"},"timeoutSeconds":{"maximum":604800,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["event","timeoutSeconds"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Data is shared only within this project. List shared data tables, creator IDs and columns. Agents with access to this store may read/write rows; only the creator may alter/drop a table or its indexes. Twenty tables per page. Data is shared across conversations, never store secrets.","name":"list_data_tables","parameters":{"a